notes.content:
//bug fixes
- Boast: When checking whether to open the exit portal it was only checking your local Score variable (it will now also check your online Score).
- Score Attack: When setting a new high score it was returning you to the Room Selection room in the wrong position.

Achievements have now been added to the game. :)


Note if you were previously eligible to unlock an island completion achievement then simply enter then exit one of the levels on that island and it should unlock the achievement.


//edit - 18th Feb
Added achievements for unlocking each of the islands.

//edit 20th Sept
Added another tier of achievements for the islands (completing 50% of the levels).

